OL,3,AGovernment's EV targets expected to be
OL,4,Areduced this week
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe UK government's electric vehicle
OL,7,F(EV) targets are expected to be reduced
OL,8,Fthis week in a move likely to be
OL,9,Fwelcomed by carmakers but opposed by
OL,10,Fenvironmental groups.
OL,12,FUnder the current rules, 80% of new
OL,13,Fcars sold in the UK must be electric by
OL,14,F2030 but industry groups have long
OL,15,Fcalled for "urgent relief".
OL,17,FNew petrol or diesel cars are due to be
OL,18,Fphased out by 2030 and by 2035 all new
OL,19,Fcars must be zero emission.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
